  "title": "Spring Greens Borscht",
  "description": "This spring or summer soup was called &#39;green borscht&#39; in my family. Made with fresh spinach, sorrel, and potatoes, it&#39;s served chilled and is very pleasant and refreshing.",
  "authors": [
    "crainny"
